WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.000
SCP-682 Vs SCP-539.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.240
Could the Perfect Distraction take 682’s
attention away from the one thing it cares

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.440
about: hatred?

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.560
A member of D-class personnel was sent into
SCP-682’s containment chamber, carrying

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.240
SCP-539.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.160
Then, the doors were shut behind them.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.920
Terrified that SCP-682 would kill them, the
D-Class threw SCP-539 early in an attempt

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:24.880
to distract it.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.320
As soon as SCP-539 was&nbsp;
thrown, the site experienced&nbsp;

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.040
a system malfunction in the containment chamber.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.760
An acid pump was activated&nbsp;
during this malfunction,&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.120
trapping SCP-682 for approximately 20 minutes

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.840
before it was deactivated by site maintenance
staff.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:45.280
By the time staff reached the containment
chamber, 85% of 682’s body had been destroyed.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:49.840
SCP-539 was found nearby, and the D-class
was completely gone.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.880
Three hours later, SCP-682 was completely
recovered, plus an additional pair of legs

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.800
grown during the healing process.

